      ],
      "en": "But she had brought them up to the roof, and hidden them under the stalks of flax which she had laid in order on the roof.",
      "ko": "실상은 그가 이미 그들을 이끌고 지붕에 올라가서 그 지붕에 벌여놓은 삼대에 숨겼더라",
      "source_text_hash": "8b19bf27716314af34a61bee17cb02f9fde2f4bb99ce811cc82ab73d1b8abb38",
      "translation_text_hash": "599e59b54c408a628ce5586d268817906c946dae5854866f5119eb6ed868d15a",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
