      "en": "The men pursued them along the way to the fords of the Jordan River. As soon as those who pursued them had gone out, they shut the gate.",
      "ko": "그 사람들은 요단 길로 나루턱까지 따라갔고 그 따르는 자들이 나가자 곧 성문을 닫았더라",
      "source_text_hash": "f72df19223a6a0003ae9c7a50d7ef635094c3eee3fd2e688d4ce06e69d87627c",
      "translation_text_hash": "26d9f0e20589749de61ed0719cdcfc1d7f82cda322545990c7e5591283d57dd1",
