      "en": "Then the two men returned, descended from the mountain, crossed the river, and came to Joshua the son of Nun. They told him all that had happened to them.",
      "ko": "그 두 사람이 돌이켜 산에서 내려와 강을 건너 눈의 아들 여호수아에게 나아와서 그 당한 모든 일을 고하고",
      "source_text_hash": "23d0ab7f365dfb6b66d64ae1155faf7e1deb802eb8bfb0c5c2c733db7abef07a",
      "translation_text_hash": "8a4e59eddda57cf5497f534a924eddab89136771e730a75f1c0ab7cc8b1e0806",
